Directory contents: vendored Lua 5.4.7 interpreter sources (src/*.c, src/*.h)
with the standalone lua/luac command-line mains removed (lua.c, luac.c) and
the upstream Makefile dropped; OGUI compiles them directly into the ogui
static library when OGUI_USE_LUA is ON.
